  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Replace the up-arrow with a ⋮ overflow menu (Open, Rename, Set related record [wired by 034], Delete).</step>
    <step order="2">Make the row body open on click.</step>
    <step order="3">Wire the existing DELETE endpoint to the Delete control.</step>
    <step order="4">Surface last-message/conversationSummary preview + message count + the tabs the session carried.</step>
    <step order="5">Group rows Today/Yesterday/This week; add search over title/preview.</step>
    <step order="6">Build + typecheck.</step>
    <step order="7">Update TASK-INDEX ✅.</step>
  </steps>
  <ui-tests>
    <test name="History rebuild">
      <steps>Verify the up-arrow is gone; row click opens; the ⋮ menu shows Open/Rename/Set related record/Delete; delete removes the row; rows show preview + tab summary ("Email · Compose"); rows are time-grouped; search filters by title/preview. Include an ADR-021 dark-mode check.</steps>
      <expected>Up-arrow gone; row click opens; ⋮ menu has the four actions; delete removes the row; rows show preview + tab summary; rows are time-grouped; search filters by title/preview; no dark-mode regressions.</expected>
    </test>
  </ui-tests>
  <justification>
    <existing>HistoryOverlay has a single up-arrow 'Promote' button and title+timestamp rows only.</existing>
    <extension>Yes — rebuild the existing component's row + add a menu; no new component.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>History is unusable — ambiguous up-arrow, no delete/rename, no preview or tab context.</cost-of-doing-nothing>
